      "en": "The first book I wrote, Theophilus, concerned all that Jesus began both to do and to teach,",
      "ko": "데오빌로여 내가 먼저 쓴 글에는 무릇 예수의 행하시며 가르치시기를 시작하심부터",
      "source_text_hash": "03d34f4a3a0a814194c617c09a73a8a15d14bb077dfc404938a6a49836197c4e",
      "translation_text_hash": "1910af2fdc1eda6ce21668866dd6c147ae1b1f723d933b546d6cd59367ee5015",
