        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "until the day in which he was received up, after he had given commandment through the Holy Spirit to the apostles whom he had chosen.",
      "ko": "그의 택하신 사도들에게 성령으로 명하시고 승천하신 날까지의 일을 기록하였노라",
      "source_text_hash": "05b450ba2a684a12c064ae8ad12b1b5d0d57e7e1cd664de4265fbcd03d2b1097",
      "translation_text_hash": "11c5d56171e4dbef0f0b6e87b90e205013cc7ed33fe5046d583b048fc972ffd4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
