      "en": "For John indeed baptized in water, but you will be baptized in the Holy Spirit not many days from now.”",
      "ko": "요한은 물로 세례를 베풀었으나 너희는 몇 날이 못되어 성령으로 세례를 받으리라 하셨느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7ed4b9bd28a5733c37e64bc593c62114993394733aa78897bea9a53232b77e3a",
      "translation_text_hash": "60b70e69a51fe870dc2e56ac9a662b9be48bec697bffa851ccdf1b7912f0436d",
