      "en": "Therefore, when they had come together, they asked him, “Lord, are you now restoring the kingdom to Israel?”",
      "ko": "저희가 모였을 때에 예수께 묻자와 가로되 주께서 이스라엘 나라를 회복하심이 이 때니이까 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "2e02486802ab9abc63b5716438a36b8bc61a69d27207e97ba6c853e36257020e",
      "translation_text_hash": "e9da6be3691f51fa4c56ae3e0752409f8b94337d0b7981aee370340242792786",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
