      "en": "He said to them, “It isn’t for you to know times or seasons which the Father has set within his own authority.",
      "ko": "가라사대 때와 기한은 아버지께서 자기의 권한에 두셨으니 너희의 알바 아니요",
      "source_text_hash": "eede272517d7eb7844a5a554d73454e649e5910dcbf78bd7850fa052a0433609",
      "translation_text_hash": "efecd668ae62b875eb86cabd78e02eb6422f5e673ca3a225ad987be12836bcb9",
