      "en": "who also said, “You men of Galilee, why do you stand looking into the sky? This Jesus, who was received up from you into the sky, will come back in the same way as you saw him going into the sky.”",
      "ko": "가로되 갈릴리 사람들아 어찌하여 서서 하늘을 쳐다 보느냐 너희 가운데서 하늘로 올리우신 이 예수는 하늘로 가심을 본 그대로 오시리라 하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "88e6e69959acb6183b9cee63ffe284b24c05b8c2d4e52ebd333885a1a18e8348",
      "translation_text_hash": "8615c9620daddbb661af715e11d8b051e6e3c1eff33c5e183a033e3919184b0a",
